","s":". n. Presents for sacrificing.\n --Comp.\n --Infin. यष्टम्, in epic poetry anomal. ईजितुम्, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 2, 1230","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":" (looks like an infin. of the redupl. pf.). Desider. यियक्ष, To wish to sacrifice, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 2, 59","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Caus. याजय, To perform a sacrifice for another, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 3, 151","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":" (also Ātm., "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 1, 8123","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":").\n --With the prep. सम् सम्, To worship, Bhaṭṭ. 15, 96.\n --Ptcple. of the fut. pass. (Caus.?), संयाज्य, n. Sacrificing, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 11, 59","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Comp.\n अ-संयाज्य, adj. one with whom nobody is allowed to sacrifice, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 9, 238","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Caus. To perform a sacrifice for another, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 1, 6375","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Cf. ἅγιος, ἁγίζω, ἁγνός."}]}]}],"yajata":[{"id":"yajata","headword":"यजत","headword_slp1":"yajata","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"यज् + अत, m. An officiating priest at a sacrifice."}]}]}],"yajati":[{"id":"yajati","headword":"यजति","headword_slp1":"yajati","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"यजति, 3. sing. pres. of यज्.\n 1. [] A technical term for those sacrifices which are denoted by the word यजति (cf. जुहोति), "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 2, 84.\n 2","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". m. A sacrifice (ŚKD.)."}]}]}],"yajatra":[{"id":"yajatra","headword":"यजत्र","headword_slp1":"yajatra","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"यज् + अत्र,\n I. adj. Adorable, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Lass. 102, 9","q":"Lass"},{"t":"txt","s":" = Rigv. vii. 14, 2.\n II. m. A Brāhmaṇa who keeps a sacrificial fire.\n III. n. Maintenance of a sacrificial fire."}]}]}],"yajana":[{"id":"yajana","headword":"यजन","headword_slp1":"yajana","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"यज् + अन, n.\n 1. Sacrificing, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 1, 88.\n 2","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". Wo